# AWS: Create an AWS Auto Scaling Group

## 1. Project Overview

This project demonstrates how to create an Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling Group using an AWS Launch Template. The Auto Scaling Group maintains the required number of EC2 instances and automatically replaces an instance when it is terminated.

The implementation uses the AWS Management Console in the Asia Pacific (Hyderabad) region.

## 2. Project Objectives

- Create an EC2 Launch Template.
- Configure an Auto Scaling Group.
- Set minimum, desired, and maximum instance capacity.
- Launch EC2 instances across multiple Availability Zones.
- Test automatic instance replacement.
- Understand Auto Scaling configuration, monitoring, and termination policies.

